220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (     NEXT, THE ACCELEROMETER IS CONFIGURED WITH A SIMPLE BUTTON IN THE SOFTWARE, EMPHASIZING THE SIMPLICITY OF THE PROGRAM FOR USERS. VARIOUS ALGORITHMS DISPLAYED IN A SIMPLE USER INTERFACE ARE ALSO AVAILABLE LIKE THE PID \(PROPORTIONAL, INTEGRAL, DERIVATIVE\) TUNING CONTROL WHICH HAS MANY PARAMETERS SUCH AS PID GAINS, RATES, EXPO, AND FILTERS WHICH ESSENTIALLY ADJUST THE MOTOR SPEEDS BASED ON THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE DESIRED ORIENTATION AND THE ACTUAL ORIENTATION OF THE AIRCRAFT, MINIMIZING ERRORS AND STABILIZING THE FLIGHT.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
